      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from the one who mentioned it, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The Quran came down with the grief, therefore recite it with the grief’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ibn abu ‘Umayr from those whom he has mentioned (in his book) from abu ‘Abd Allah who has said the following: “The Holy Quran has come down with sadness, thus, you should read it with sadness.” "
        ]
      }
